# 基础词 Unit05
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit05核心词汇

{{attempt}}{/əˈtempt/}{{v./n. 尝试；企图}}{{He attempted to climb the mountain but failed.}}
{{attend}}{/əˈtend/}{{v. 出席；照料}}{{Over 200 people attended the conference.}}
{{attention}}{/əˈtenʃn/}{{n. 注意；关注}}{{Please pay attention to the safety instructions.}}
{{attitude}}{/ˈætɪtjuːd/}{{n. 态度；看法}}{{A positive attitude can help you succeed.}}
{{attract}}{/əˈtrækt/}{{v. 吸引}}{{The beautiful scenery attracts many tourists.}}
{{attribute}}{/əˈtrɪbjuːt/}{{v. 归因于；n. 属性}}{{She attributed her success to hard work.}}
{{audience}}{/ˈɔːdiəns/}{{n. 观众；听众}}{{The audience applauded loudly after the performance.}}
{{authority}}{/ɔːˈθɒrəti/}{{n. 权威；当局}}{{The local authority approved the construction project.}}
{{automatic}}{/ˌɔːtəˈmætɪk/}{{adj. 自动的}}{{The doors have an automatic opening system.}}
{{available}}{/əˈveɪləbl/}{{adj. 可用的；有空的}}{{Tickets are available online and at the box office.}}
{{average}}{/ˈævərɪdʒ/}{{n. 平均；adj. 平均的}}{{The average temperature in summer is 30 degrees.}}
{{avoid}}{/əˈvɔɪd/}{{v. 避免；避开}}{{You should avoid eating too much junk food.}}
{{awake}}{/əˈweɪk/}{{adj. 醒着的；v. 唤醒}}{{I was awake all night worrying about the exam.}}
{{award}}{/əˈwɔːrd/}{{n. 奖；奖品；v. 授予}}{{She received an award for her outstanding research.}}
{{aware}}{/əˈweər/}{{adj. 意识到的；知道的}}{{He was not aware of the danger ahead.}}
{{awful}}{/ˈɔːfl/}{{adj. 可怕的；糟糕的}}{{The weather was awful during our vacation.}}
{{awkward}}{/ˈɔːkwərd/}{{adj. 尴尬的；笨拙的}}{{There was an awkward silence after his remark.}}
{{background}}{/ˈbækɡraʊnd/}{{n. 背景；经历}}{{She has a strong background in computer science.}}
{{backward}}{/ˈbækwərd/}{{adj./adv. 向后的；落后的}}{{The region is economically backward compared to others.}}
{{bacteria}}{/bækˈtɪəriə/}{{n. 细菌}}{{Bacteria can cause various types of infections.}}
{{balance}}{/ˈbæləns/}{{n. 平衡；v. 使平衡}}{{It is important to maintain a balance between work and life.}}
{{ban}}{/bæn/}{{v. 禁止；n. 禁令}}{{The government banned smoking in public places.}}
{{band}}{/bænd/}{{n. 乐队；带；一帮}}{{The band performed at the music festival last weekend.}}
{{bank}}{/bæŋk/}{{n. 银行；河岸}}{{She deposited the check at the bank.}}
{{bar}}{/bɑːr/}{{n. 酒吧；条；障碍}}{{They met at a bar after work.}}
{{bare}}{/beər/}{{adj. 赤裸的；空的；v. 暴露}}{{The trees were bare in winter.}}
{{bargain}}{/ˈbɑːrɡən/}{{n. 便宜货；交易；v. 讨价还价}}{{This coat was a real bargain at half price.}}
{{barrier}}{/ˈbæriər/}{{n. 障碍；屏障}}{{Language can be a barrier to communication.}}
{{base}}{/beɪs/}{{n. 基础；基地；v. 以…为基础}}{{The company is based in New York City.}}
{{basic}}{/ˈbeɪsɪk/}{{adj. 基本的；基础的}}{{Reading is a basic skill for all students.}}
{{basis}}{/ˈbeɪsɪs/}{{n. 基础；根据}}{{The theory has no scientific basis.}}
{{basket}}{/ˈbɑːskɪt/}{{n. 篮子；篮}}{{She put the fruit in a basket on the table.}}
{{bat}}{/bæt/}{{n. 蝙蝠；球棒}}{{The bat flew out of the cave at dusk.}}
{{bath}}{/bɑːθ/}{{n. 洗澡；浴缸}}{{I took a hot bath after a long day at work.}}
{{battle}}{/ˈbætl/}{{n. 战斗；v. 作战}}{{The battle lasted for several days.}}
{{bear}}{/beər/}{{v. 承受；忍受；n. 熊}}{{She could not bear the pain any longer.}}
{{beat}}{/biːt/}{{v. 打；击败；n. 节拍}}{{Our team beat the对手in the final match.}}
{{beautiful}}{/ˈbjuːtɪfl/}{{adj. 美丽的；漂亮的}}{{The sunset over the ocean was truly beautiful.}}
{{because}}{/bɪˈkɒz/}{{conj. 因为}}{{I stayed home because I was feeling sick.}}
{{become}}{/bɪˈkʌm/}{{v. 成为；变得}}{{She became a doctor after years of hard study.}}
